    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fa3670933f06d15",
      "translationZh": "Notion 链接（便于阅读）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "340f463033e0fd5d",
      "translationZh": "代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32ab92ed12869d90",
      "translationZh": "下面我们对比 DIFF V2 与 DIFF V1：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cc8015a536539c8",
      "translationZh": "（为简化起见，我们省略批次维度，并假设下文 flash_attn_func 的输入和输出均为三维张量（词元、注意力头、头维度）。属于同一 GQA 组的注意力头在输出中连续排列）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37367786dab8e498",
      "translationZh": "注意，DIFF V2 将同一 GQA 组内的两个注意力头相减，这意味着它们共享相同的键和值。这对性能至关重要。请参阅设计消融实验部分和 Github 代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e84a2dd56fe5537",
      "translationZh": "完整代码见：unilm/Diff-Transformer/Diff-Transformer-V2 at master · microsoft/unilm。在脚本中，h 表示查询头的数量，h_kv 表示键值头的数量，d 表示头维度。DIFF V2 中的 λ\\lambdaλ 是针对每个词元的每个注意力头，从 XXX 投影得到的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c9b04ac9d71a942",
      "translationZh": "DIFF V2 将查询头的数量增加一倍，同时保持键值头的数量不变，并在差分运算后将额外的维度缩减回 h*d，因此 WOW_OWO​ 投影与基线 Transformer 保持相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89b1f4c3df983454",
      "translationZh": "设计动机",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c0d70dd22b59ba13",
      "translationZh": "更快的解码，无需自定义内核",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f0456eb1820e132",
      "translationZh": "与基线 Transformer 相比，DIFF V2 引入了额外的查询头，但并未增加键值（KV）头的数量。由于大语言模型的解码通常受内存带宽限制，这种设计使 DIFF V2 能够达到与标准 Transformer 相当的解码速度。此外，由于查询、键和值的头维度一致，DIFF V2 无需自定义注意力内核。相比之下，DIFF V1 在解码时可能更慢，因为值缓存必须加载两次，而且需要自定义注意力内核。DIFF V2 还可以提高解码期间注意力模块的算术强度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd9003005a7e1e7c",
      "translationZh": "在预训练期间，在 H 系列和 B 系列 GPU 上使用先进的 FlashAttention 内核时，DIFF V2 带来的吞吐量下降可以忽略不计。对于长序列预填充，我们建议将 DIFF V2 与 YOCO 等技术结合使用（Gemma 3n 也使用了 YOCO），这些技术已将预填充复杂度降低为相对于序列长度的线性时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3d2deea788c70d38",
      "translationZh": "另一种视角是，将 DIFF V2 与查询维度同为 2h*d 的 Transformer 进行比较。在这种比较下，两个模型的注意力内核速度相同，而 DIFF V2 在输出投影中的参数量和浮点运算量更少。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "79b400809004e5ab",
      "translationZh": "Softmax 幅度约束",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac54a191503662dc",
      "translationZh": "在标准的缩放点积注意力（SDPA）中，设 Q,K,V∈Rn×dQ, K, V \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n \\times d}Q,K,V∈Rn×d 分别为查询、键和值。上下文向量 CCC 定义为：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8635150b4c599d7",
      "translationZh": "其中，A∈Rn×nA \\in \\mathbb{R}^{n \\times n}A∈Rn×n 是注意力权重矩阵。我们聚焦于 CCC 的某一行，将其记为 ci\\mathbf{c}_ici​，它是值向量 vj\\mathbf{v}_jvj​ 的加权和：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c1e601bbd7af14d",
      "translationZh": "我们定义上下文均方根（Context RMS，Root Mean Square）来表示这一输出的幅度：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7e7145af447b42d",
      "translationZh": "权重 aija_{ij}aij​ 非负，且总和为 1（∑j=1naij=1\\sum_{j=1}^{n} a_{ij} = 1∑j=1n​aij​=1）。假设值向量 vj\\mathbf{v}_jvj​ 互不相关，且均方根为 1，那么无论注意力分布如何变化，上下文均方根都严格限定在范围 [1n,1)[\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}},1)[n​1​,1) 内：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "178258a3982915ed",
      "translationZh": "如果注意力完全集中在一个词元上，上下文均方根为 111。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e00494439ae98777",
      "translationZh": "如果注意力均匀分布在所有词元上（aij=1na_{ij} = \\frac{1}{n}aij​=n1​），上下文均方根就会降至 1n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}n​1​。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3e6973ff29834e59",
      "translationZh": "在其他情况下，上下文 RMS 介于 1n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{n}}n​1​ 和 111 之间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5df6b31a68044bf3",
      "translationZh": "在 DIFF V1 中，我们对每个头的上下文向量添加 RMSNorm：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09a5f6aca55f90c0",
      "translationZh": "如果模型在某个头中学到均匀的注意力分布，上下文 RMS 就大约为 1/n1/\\sqrt{n}1/n​。要将其归一化回 111，RMSNorm 必须将向量乘以 n\\sqrt{n}n​ 的缩放系数。当 n=8192n = 8192n=8192 时，n≈90.5\\sqrt{n} \\approx 90.5n​≈90.5。这意味着 RMSNorm 层会将输出放大 100 倍。在大规模预训练中，我们发现这会导致巨大的梯度和数值不稳定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11633185708bf94a",
      "translationZh": "一个典型现象是，当 DIFF V1 以较大的学习率进行预训练时，与 Transformer 相比，其梯度范数在训练后期的增幅更大，方差也更高。在 DIFF V2 中，移除逐头 RMSNorm 后，梯度范数的量级变得与 Transformer 相当，梯度范数的尖峰也有所减小（下文将进一步讨论）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "62138a63bf3fc776",
      "translationZh": "我们在 DIFF V1 中采用逐头 RMSNorm 设计，主要是因为值头维度翻倍，以及所有词元全局共享 λ\\lambdaλ。鉴于 DIFF V2 对这两个方面所做的修改，我们发现现在可以安全地移除 RMSNorm。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e7ef916ede3bd76d",
      "translationZh": "突破 Softmax 约束并消除注意力汇聚点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9810135ddf31f3be",
      "translationZh": "我们证明，DIFF V2 能够克服上述 Softmax 约束。它还可以帮助消除注意力汇聚点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "16b8bacc69eef5f8",
      "translationZh": "在原始 Softmax 注意力中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cb829ae19188599a",
      "translationZh": "在 DIFF V2 中，我们为每个词元的每个注意力头引入一个通过投影得到的 λ\\lambdaλ：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4303a3f12be8fe34",
      "translationZh": "通过投影得到的 λi\\lambda_iλi​ 有助于控制上下文的均方根（RMS）。我们观察到，将上下文 RMS 的下界降至零尤为重要。这有助于消除注意力汇聚现象，并提高训练稳定性。上界只需保持有界即可。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "31480122eb3bcf03",
      "translationZh": "请注意，我们这里分析的是输出投影 WOW_OWO​ 之前的 RMS。尽管可以在输出投影之后恢复并调整 RMS，但 Softmax 处自由度的缺乏仍然会影响学习性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7732016120325042",
      "translationZh": "近期的其他工作也缓解了这一约束：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0050854f3a87021b",
      "translationZh": "在《Attention Is Off By One》中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "03c5b3d2ec4d6ad2",
      "translationZh": "在 gpt-oss 中，为每个注意力头引入了一个可学习标量 sss：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "323e2e1ce3b74b00",
      "translationZh": "在门控注意力中，乘上了一个通过投影得到的逐元素 sigmoid 门：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e87536fb9d4c1445",
      "translationZh": "实验观察",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "920e48120e436367",
      "translationZh": "我们在生产规模的大语言模型上开展预训练实验，包括稠密模型和一个 30A3 MoE，使用数万亿个 token 进行训练，采用 6e-4 至 1e-3 的较大学习率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32b3f1fd9a6a5cf8",
      "translationZh": "实验仍在进行中。目前我们观察到的情况如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4468165da83e859c",
      "translationZh": "与 Transformer 相比，语言建模损失显著更低（在训练 token 数达到 1T 时，差距为 0.02 至 0.03）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "777caec352052d62",
      "translationZh": "减少了训练过程中的损失尖峰和梯度尖峰，尤其是在 Transformer 基线变得不稳定的大学习率设置下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9bd5e05a18c41d82",
      "translationZh": "降低了激活值离群值的幅度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32a5b0fe43f879b4",
      "translationZh": "我们预计将在训练的后续阶段探索：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "30cfe71cc5bfd584",
      "translationZh": "中期训练和后训练阶段的学习效率。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d96c11dff44eb9e",
      "translationZh": "在下游长上下文基准测试中的表现（缓解上下文退化）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "60157cfcfe3f31c3",
      "translationZh": "讨论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b0c1ee4a13f6efa6",
      "translationZh": "差分运算的构造",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "683698c728d337ac",
      "translationZh": "理论上，一个具有 2h2h2h 个注意力头的标准 Transformer 可以通过学习 WO2i=−WO2i+1,i=0,1,…,h−1W_O^{2i}=-W_O^{2i+1}, i=0,1,\\ldots,h-1WO2i​=−WO2i+1​,i=0,1,…,h−1 来学会差分运算，其中 WOiW_O^{i}WOi​ 表示第 iii 个头的输出投影，而第 2i2i2i 个头和第 2i+12i+12i+1 个头属于同一个 GQA 组。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1c2dbb3018404c1",
      "translationZh": "假设 1。在实践中，这样的解很难通过优化学到，因为它要求两组参数收敛到彼此精确相反的值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "285b4fb2b88abedf",
      "translationZh": "假设 2。模型能够学会差分运算，并且模型在训练中选择学习它。那么，像 DIFF V2 那样在输出投影之前显式构造差分运算，就可以节省一半的 WOW_OWO​ 参数。节省的参数数量也相当可观。在当前的 GQA 设置下，注意力模块的参数主要集中在 WQW_QWQ​ 和 WOW_OWO​ 中；因此，可以节省约 25% 的注意力模块参数。节省下来的参数预算随后可以重新分配给模型的其他部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "868ced302af6eb21",
      "translationZh": "即使 DIFF V2 在重新分配参数后，损失并未低于基线，而只是与之持平，只要该方法能带来额外收益，例如改善训练稳定性、更好地控制异常值或提高训练效率，它仍然是有价值的。这类似于 GQA：它在达到与 MHA 相同损失的同时，还带来了减少 KV-cache 的额外收益。因此，关键问题就变成了实证表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f64930a4e437ccb3",
      "translationZh": "设计消融实验",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1932f7b0dde34c92",
      "translationZh": "将不属于同一个 GQA 组的两个头相减，这意味着它们不共享相同的键和值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7cc8015a536539c8",
      "translationZh": "（为简单起见，我们省略批次维度，并假设下面的 flash_attn_func 的输入和输出均为三维张量（词元、头、头维度）。属于同一个 GQA 组的头在输出中连续排列）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2797ef9cffcc7d8",
      "translationZh": "在我们采用较大学习率的设置下，消融实验 1 的设置表现出明显的训练不稳定性（损失尖峰和梯度尖峰多得多），而且损失高于 DIFF V2。正如 DIFF V1 论文所讨论的，用于相减的两个头应当共享值，以构造差分运算。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8aee3e44df70aec0",
      "translationZh": "将两个注意力图相减，但不使用 λ\\lambdaλ 缩放因子，即使用 attn1 - attn2，而不是 attn1 - lam_val * attn2。这会导致初始化时上下文的均方根（RMS）过小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e27b612871f73ace",
      "translationZh": "直接使用投影得到的 λ\\lambdaλ，而不应用 sigmoid 操作。上下文的 RMS 没有上界。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "353968d45c0d9df2",
      "translationZh": "消融实验 2 和消融实验 3 的语言建模损失都高于 DIFF V2。消融实验 2 保持了与 DIFF V2 相近的训练稳定性，而消融实验 3 的稳定性较差（但仍比消融实验 1 更稳定）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f736714fc67a37ce",
      "translationZh": "一个具有 1.5*h 个注意力头的 Transformer，其参数量与 DIFF V2 对齐。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f44abb7efb60062",
      "translationZh": "消融实验 4 的训练损失也高于 DIFF V2。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5cb0b42660589925",
      "translationZh": "其他事项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "519a4930dd73a850",
      "translationZh": "在 DIFF 中，qk logits 中的离群值可能比基线中的更小。DIFF V1 中已经对此进行过分析：DIFF 可以在使用更小的 qk logits 的同时，实现与基线相当的注意力稀疏性。我们进一步提出，DIFF 的差分机制会抵消较小的注意力值，因此可能有助于缓解这篇博客和论文中讨论的注意力舍入误差问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3990f7c368facbdd",
      "translationZh": "DIFF V2 与稀疏注意力兼容。在许多现有的稀疏注意力框架中，为了最大限度地加速，同一 GQA 组内的查询头需要关注相同的键值块。一种常见策略是根据各个头的平均注意力 logits 来选择键值块。对于 DIFF V2，问题转变为：为包含成对差分头的更大 GQA 组设计有效的块选择策略。这可能需要在选择时分别处理这两类差分头，也可能在实践中，简单地对注意力 logits 取平均就已经足够。从概念上讲，与标准 Transformer 的块稀疏注意力相比，这并未引入任何根本性的差异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
